{
    "title": "MyNM by Northwestern Medicine",
    "description": "See your medical records, schedule a visit, message your care team, find a healthcare professional, and more with the Northwestern Medicine app for Android.  \r\nThe MyNM app is a secure app for patients powered by MyChart.   With MyNM, you can: \r\n\r\nManage Your Health:\r\n<b>\u2022</b> See your health information and lab results\r\n<b>\u2022</b> Securely message your physician and care team.\r\n<b>\u2022</b> Schedule new appointments\r\n<b>\u2022</b> Request prescription refills\r\n<b>\u2022</b> View statements and pay your bill\r\n<b>\u2022</b> Track your health and fitness when you enroll in self-tracking programs.\r\n\r\nFind Care\r\n<b>\u2022</b> Search healthcare professionals by specialty, insurance carrier, language preferences, and more.\r\n<b>\u2022</b> View profiles for over 4,000 Northwestern Medicine physicians.\r\n<b>\u2022</b> See nearby Northwestern Medicine locations, including Emergency Departments and Immediate Care Centers.\r\n\r\nAccess Visitor Resources:\r\n<b>\u2022</b> View parking and transportation options\r\n<b>\u2022</b> Access hospital maps and view on-site amenities\r\n<b>\u2022</b> View nearby hotels and lodging",
    "descriptionHTML": "See your medical records, schedule a visit, message your care team, find a healthcare professional, and more with the Northwestern Medicine app for Android.  <br>The MyNM app is a secure app for patients powered by MyChart.   With MyNM, you can: <br><br>Manage Your Health:<br><b>\u2022</b> See your health information and lab results<br><b>\u2022</b> Securely message your physician and care team.<br><b>\u2022</b> Schedule new appointments<br><b>\u2022</b> Request prescription refills<br><b>\u2022</b> View statements and pay your bill<br><b>\u2022</b> Track your health and fitness when you enroll in self-tracking programs.<br><br>Find Care<br><b>\u2022</b> Search healthcare professionals by specialty, insurance carrier, language preferences, and more.<br><b>\u2022</b> View profiles for over 4,000 Northwestern Medicine physicians.<br><b>\u2022</b> See nearby Northwestern Medicine locations, including Emergency Departments and Immediate Care Centers.<br><br>Access Visitor Resources:<br><b>\u2022</b> View parking and transportation options<br><b>\u2022</b> Access hospital maps and view on-site amenities<br><b>\u2022</b> View nearby hotels and lodging",
